# USA Wi-Fi Calling (Red Pocket GSMA/AT&T, Red Pocket GSMT & Ultra/T-Mobile)
# Classical rule provider for Shadowrocket and Mihomo; caller assigns 📶 USA Cellular.
# FQDNs only. Do not use a blanket pub.3gppnetwork.org / att.net / analysis-CDN suffix.
# UDP 500/4500 for IP-only ePDG sessions must be handled in caller rules / gateway routing.

# Red Pocket account & AT&T Wi-Fi Calling (AT&T published FQDNs)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,redpocket.com
DOMAIN,epdg.epc.att.net
DOMAIN,sentitlement2.mobile.att.net
DOMAIN,vvm.mobile.att.net

# Ultra Mobile / Red Pocket GSMT: T-Mobile ePDG
DOMAIN,ss.epdg.epc.mnc260.mcc310.pub.3gppnetwork.org
DOMAIN,epdg.epc.mnc260.mcc310.pub.3gppnetwork.org
DOMAIN,ss.epdg.epc.geo.mnc260.mcc310.pub.3gppnetwork.org
DOMAIN,crl.t-mobile.com
